cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AE-TIRT in research, please cite this software."
title: "AE-TIRT: Autoencoder-Based Thurstonian IRT Toolkit"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-02-15"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/XunqiangQi/ae-tirt"
abstract: >-
  AE-TIRT is a research-oriented Python toolkit for forced-choice assessment
  under the Thurstonian IRT framework. It combines amortized inference via
  an autoencoder encoder with a theory-constrained decoder implementing the
  Thurstonian measurement equation.
authors:
  - family-names: "Qi"
    given-names: "Xunqiang"
